{"id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bounded-induction-schemes.md","title":"IND, PIND and LIND Schemes","display":"df-bounded-induction-schemes — IND, PIND and LIND Schemes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","aliases":["72-df-bounded-induction-schemes"],"display":"df-bounded-induction-schemes — IND, PIND and LIND Schemes","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","[[72-df-substitution-formula]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.2.2; §1.3.3.1","source_printed_pages":"83, 101","source_pdf_pages":"95, 113","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-induction-schemes — IND, PIND and LIND Schemes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.2.2; §1.3.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"83, 101"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"95, 113"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\">\\(L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 为归纳变量；其余自由变量保留为参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[t/x]\">\\(A[t/x]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(A,t,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(A,t,x)\\)</span>；该接口以最小新变量实现确定性的捕获避免，不另行选择未指定的改名代表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_L\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIND},\\mathrm{LIND}\">\\(\\mathrm{PIND},\\mathrm{LIND}\\)</span> 的两式仅取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PIND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A[\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor/x]\\to A))\\to\\forall x A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PIND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A[\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor/x]\\to A))\\to\\forall x A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LIND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x A[|x|/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LIND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x A[|x|/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\mathrm{IND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\mathrm{IND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(\\mathrm{PIND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\qquad\n\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(\\mathrm{LIND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(\\mathrm{PIND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\qquad\n\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(\\mathrm{LIND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II 印刷 pp. 83、101（PDF pp. 95、113）。PIND 是除二前驱归纳，LIND 是结论只要求到输入长度的归纳；两者不能以相同定义冒名。</li>\n<li>原书允许自由参数。参数全部全称闭包；代入接口的捕获规避条件已写入 Hypothesis。</li>\n<li>这些是公理模式的句子集合，未宣称在任意基础理论上相互等价。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span> 的相关可证性见新增包含关系定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A[t/x]$ 取 [[72-df-substitution-formula]] 的 $\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(A,t,x)$；该接口以最小新变量实现确定性的捕获避免，不另行选择未指定的改名代表。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$，$\\operatorname{ucl}_L$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]。$\\mathrm{PIND},\\mathrm{LIND}$ 的两式仅取 $L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubFml}_L(A,t,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PIND},\\mathrm{LIND}","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PIND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A[\\lfloor x/2\\rfloor/x]\\to A))\\to\\forall x A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LIND}_x(A):=(A[0/x]\\land\\forall x(A\\to A[Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x A[|x|/x].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_L(\\mathrm{IND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(\\mathrm{PIND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\qquad\n\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(\\mathrm{LIND}_x(A)):A\\in\\Phi,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"i\\geq1","display":false}],"bytes":2666,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes|df-bounded-induction-schemes — IND, PIND and LIND Schemes]]"},{"id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 是本语言全部有界公式（[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]），$\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]。"},{"id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}$ 是 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]] 的句子公理模式；$S_2^i$ 和 $S_2$ 为下式定义的公理集合。"},{"id":"bde0adecda9b3967","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}$ 是 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]] 的句子公理模式；$T_2^i,T_2$ 为下式定义的公理集合。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-bounded-induction-schemes|df-bounded-induction-schemes — IND, PIND and LIND Schemes]]"},{"id":"5a54a39d9f6bac76","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1$，$S_2^j,T_2^j,S_2,T_2$ 取 [[72-df-s2-theory]]、[[72-df-t2-theory]]；$\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}$、$\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}$、$\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-bounded-induction-schemes|72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]"}],"outgoing":["5635e2f9f2823a2f","bab190ea1c0904c8"]}